<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87627" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προκαλ-ίζομαι</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		 only pres. and impf., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>call forth, challenge, defy,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κούρους προκαλίζετο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.807
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				7.150
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προκαλίζετο πάντας ἀρίστους ἀντίβιον
					μαχέσασθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					3.19
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλ᾽ ὅ γ᾽ ἀεθλεύειν προκαλίζετο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					4.389
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μιν προκαλίζετο τοξάζεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					8.228
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χερσὶ δὲ μή τι λίην προκαλίζεο</span>
			<i>challenge</i> me not to a pugilistic combat, <i><span class="en">
				18.20
			</span></i>.</div>
